13
00:00:37,029 --> 00:00:38,885
Margaret confirms each answer.

14
00:00:40,578 --> 00:00:43,803
Since lorazepam started, dizziness was recorded on 9

15
00:00:43,803 --> 00:00:46,905
of 14 answered days, compared with 2 of 19 before.

16
00:00:46,905 --> 00:00:50,564
One fall and two near-falls were recorded on those 14 days.

17
00:00:50,564 --> 00:00:54,223
It shows a change in what was recorded, not what caused it.

18
00:00:56,210 --> 00:00:59,799
Deterministic code, not AI, checks her eight medicines

19
