24
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:20,206
The safety net: code checked the model's wording and

25
00:01:20,206 --> 00:01:22,703
removed a sentence with wording its rules block.

26
00:01:24,826 --> 00:01:28,194
Dizziness: Fisher's exact test, p = 0.0023, and it

27
00:01:28,194 --> 00:01:31,494
